OL,3,GNEWSAPiles of fly-tipped waste cleared
OL,4,Afrom estate
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe local authority believes some of
OL,7,Fthe waste had been dumped by criminals
OL,8,Fand a "minority of residents" ahead of
OL,9,FBonfire Night and there had been plans
OL,10,Fto set both piles alight.
